# Common Challenges in SOC Operations

Even mature SOCs face operational challenges, including:

- Alert fatigue
- False positives
- Increasing attack sophistication
- Large volumes of telemetry
- Skills shortages
- Hybrid infrastructure complexity
- Manual investigation processes

Addressing these challenges requires continuous improvement of detection logic, automation, and analyst workflows.

